    <h2>Practical Information</h2>
    <p>Climate therapy is possible year-round, with each season offering its own advantages: spring and autumn are considered ideal for allergy sufferers, summer provides the most intense phytoncide concentration, and winter strengthens the immune system through cold stimuli. A climate therapy course ideally lasts 14-21 days to achieve lasting effects.</p>

    <p>The terrain cure paths are accessible year-round and free of charge. For optimal therapeutic benefit, however, a medical consultation is recommended, during which an individual exercise plan is created that takes your health status and fitness level into account.</p>
  </PillarPage>
